## Summary
A rare tornado struck southern France, injuring 39 people and damaging approximately 300 homes according to local officials. The event is notable for its rarity, and videos of the incident are referenced.

## Key Points
- A rare tornado occurred in southern France.
- 39 people were injured as a result.
- Around 300 homes sustained damage.
- Local officials provided information on the incident.
- Videos of the tornado are available online.


